<node id="GDEC-001"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-001 · Windows distribution is a portable folder containing an executable and bundled dependencies; no</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-002"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-002 · Android APK distribution is acceptable</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-003"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-003 · Painting and whiteboarding are equally important in release one</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-004"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-004 · Personal use across devices; collaborative editing is outside release one</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-005"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-005 · Open-source release; license remains undecided</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-006"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-006 · Smooth, responsive pen interaction is a primary release criterion</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-007"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-007 · Prepare requirements, architecture, UX, tests and automation before production coding</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-008"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-008 · Independent cross-model QA is desired: Codex builder with Claude Code QA, or the reverse</data></node>
<node id="REQ-001"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-001 · Infinite canvas, zoom, pan, multiple saved boards, cut/copy/paste, lasso, ruler, eraser</data></node>
<node id="REQ-002"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-002 · Vector and raster drawing on one board; editable curve control points and dedicated curve pen t</data></node>
<node id="REQ-003"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-003 · Pen, pencil, marker, airbrush, watercolour, imported texture brushes</data></node>
<node id="REQ-004"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-004 · Layers, clipping masks, transparency/opacity and blending modes; brush size and opacity control</data></node>
<node id="REQ-005"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-005 · Pressure-sensitive drawing and adjustable stabilization for handwriting</data></node>
<node id="REQ-006"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-006 · Two-finger double tap undo, three-finger double tap redo, stationary hold colour picker and hel</data></node>
<node id="REQ-007"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-007 · Gaussian blur and gap-aware paint bucket inspired by Clip Studio Paint</data></node>
<node id="REQ-008"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-008 · Colour wheel, hue/saturation controls and different paper options; review Concepts colour/works</data></node>
<node id="REQ-009"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-009 · Local timelapse recording and video export; framing and retention remain unresolved</data></node>
<node id="REQ-010"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-010 · Google Drive synchronization with local offline work</data></node>
<node id="REQ-011"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-011 · Optional BYOK AI to summarize/diagram selected ideas and export DOCX, PDF, JPG</data></node>
<node id="REQ-012"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-012 · Automated checkpoint coding, adversarial frontend and backend/engine tests, Gatekeeper review, </data></node>
<node id="REQ-013"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-013 · Maintain the project knowledge graph during design and coding, not retrospectively at release</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-009"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-009 · Human review occurs in batches of approximately 2–4 checkpoints, not after every checkpoint</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-010"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-010 · AI summarization/diagramming is included in release one, after validation of base features</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-011"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-011 · Default pen draws; fingers navigate and invoke gestures</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-012"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-012 · Include smudge/blending brush using documented Procreate interactions: shared Paint/Smudge/Eras</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-013"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-013 · Experimental Procreate brush import is accepted after native brush validation</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-014"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-014 · Both image and selected PDF-page import are included</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-015"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-015 · Editable text boxes, sticky notes and attached connectors are included</data></node>
<node id="REQ-014"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-014 · Reference image box, colour picker, good inking pens, long-touch colour sampling, Concepts-insp</data></node>
<node id="REQ-015"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-015 · Canvas/artboard dimensions and DPI controls</data></node>
<node id="REQ-016"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-016 · Exchange artwork with Clip Studio Paint and Procreate</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-016"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-016 · Stationary hold colour picker; draw then hold endpoint for straightening/shape recognition</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-017"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-017 · Drive sync preserves both conflicting board revisions; user chooses which to continue</data></node>
<node id="REQ-017"><data key="type">Requirement</data><data key="name">REQ-017 · Support moving selected/lassoed content along a path and audience-view pan/zoom</data></node>
<node id="GDEC-018"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">GDEC-018 · Motion Trace</data></node>
